{"id":"d_main_30_02","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch30","label":"Chapter 30 · Treasure"},"label":"Sixo","stage":"30-9 STAGE · End","prev":"d_main_30_01_e","next":"d_main_30_03_s","speakers":{"liveryn":"Liveryn","fragile":"Fragile","anis":"Anis","neon":"Neon","drilley":"Drilley"},"icons":{"liveryn":"si_c480_00_s","fragile":"si_c481_00_s","anis":"si_c012_00_s","neon":"si_c011_00_s","drilley":"si_c491_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_30_02_1","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_1","text":"After calming Fragile and Liveryn down, it's time for that much-needed conversation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"WhiteHouse","bgArt":"whitehouse","image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":["rapi","anis","neon","fragile","liveryn","drilley","elegg"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_2","text":"I told you before, didn't I?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"bgm_intotheswarm","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_3","text":"Since regular parcel deliveries had slowed to a trickle, I was doing private courier jobs for high-profile individuals.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_4","text":"I hated it with every fiber of my being,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_5","text":"and so I got into some risky business that I thought I could do for a little while and then get out of.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_6","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_7","text":"I'm sure by now you can guess who I got involved with.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_8","text":"I had delivered mysterious packages to secretive locations.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_9","text":"I never knew what the contents of these packages were, and I didn't want to know.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_10","text":"All the delivery locations were far-flung, desolate areas with no recipients. Secured warehouses. The Outer Rim.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_11","text":"Eventually, I started to garner a bit of a reputation in the underworld and became what they call a \"transporter\".","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_12","text":"It was an easy job","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"City_d","bgArt":"city_d","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_13","text":"since I know the Ark like the back of my hand, and I'm good at what I do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_14","text":"So, I managed to earn a fair amount.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_15","text":"It felt like I was finally being rewarded after going through all that torment.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_16","text":"The anguish from losing my job to robots. The embarrassment of having to become a dancing monkey for affluent prigs.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_17","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_18","text":"I couldn't bring myself to quit.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"OuterRim","bgArt":"outerrim","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_19","text":"Before long, I found myself transporting illegal contraband,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_20","text":"and the money kept rolling in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_21","text":"My house got bigger. I started to wear luxury brands. I dined at five-star restaurants. All of these things I never got to enjoy before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Restaurant","bgArt":"restaurant","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_22","text":"Life was good","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_23","text":"and so I kept at it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_24","text":"Until everything went horribly wrong,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_25","text":"and someone close to me died.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CrystalCity","bgArt":"crystalcity","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["rapi","anis","neon","fragile","liveryn","drilley","elegg"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_26","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_27","text":"After that, I went clean and returned to my original job.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_28","text":"I promised myself that I would never do such a thing again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_29","text":"We promised each other that if she were to ever get involved in that kind of thing again,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_30","text":"we would die together.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_31","text":"You didn't know about the job?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_32","text":"... No, I didn't.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_33","text":"I just thought that business was going well for her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_34","text":"Okay, fair. But a suicide pact? A bit over the top, don't you think?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_35","text":"The person who died...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_36","text":"was my sister.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_37","text":"...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_38","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_39","text":"It wasn't Liveryn's fault that she died. But my sister died because she was involved in the whole sordid business.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_40","text":"It was the job that got her killed. So if she decided to do that job again,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_41","text":"it would be out of pure greed and disregard for my sister's death.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_42","text":"I would have to kill her, but then that would leave me all alone, so I would have to off myself as well.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_43","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_43","text":"I presume Sixo was the provider of these jobs?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_44","text":"You know Sixo?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_45","text":"Just her name.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_46","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_46","text":"How can I ever forget? That tragedy caused by the Mist remains etched in my memory, vivid as if it happened yesterday.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["backyard_event"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_47","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_47","text":"And then there's the ordeal with Moran, too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_48","text":"Was it Sixo who sent you here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["rapi","anis","neon","fragile","liveryn","drilley","elegg"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_49","text":"Bet that's why you've been checking your phone.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_50","text":"That's... right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_51","text":"They said to bring back \"something else no one has obtained before\".","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_52","text":"Since we're exploring uncharted territory, the likelihood of encountering such an item is high.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_53","text":"So that photo of the Unknown...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_54","text":"Yes, I intended to bring that to them since I can't take any of the crystals.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_55","text":"I'm sorry, everyone. I've fouled everything up.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_56","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_57","text":"I thought I had washed my hands of all this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_58","text":"I thought there was no reason for me to get involved in any of this ever again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_59","text":"But every time I think I'm out, they pull me back in.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_60","text":"The only thing I asked was for this to be kept a secret from Fragile, but Sixo wouldn't even grant me that...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_61","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_62","text":"I thought Sixo was lying.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_63","text":"After what we went through, I never expected you to work with them again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_64","text":"What can I say? Your ability to betray your friends exceeds my expectations.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_65","text":"Were you short on money again? Was that it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_66","text":"No, that's not it...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_67","text":"What was it then?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_68","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_69","text":"They said they would tell Ingrid that I used to be a transporter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_70","text":"If they did that, my memory would be erased, or worse, I might be scrapped altogether.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_71","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_72","text":"You're in too deep, Liveryn.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_73","text":"You'll never be able to escape.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_74","text":"They'll hold that over your head for the rest of your days.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_75","text":"... I'm sorry to interrupt,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_76","text":"but wouldn't honesty be the best policy here?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_77","text":"Tell Sixo you're done dealing with them,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_78","text":"then head straight to Ingrid. Lay it out honestly and ask for her help.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_79","text":"Heh... hehe...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_80","text":"You're right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_81","text":"That's all I have to do.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_82","text":"Isn't it strange?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_83","text":"All I have to do is receive the punishment for my past sins, and start over again.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_84","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_84","text":"But I don't want to lose anything.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_85","text":"It's so strange. Even when I hear myself saying that, it seems strange.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_86","text":"I thought that if I could create some distance, things could return to the way they were.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_87","text":"Even though deep down, I knew it was probably wishful thinking... I continued to hold onto that hope.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_88","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_88","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_89","text":"Fine, I'll tell Ingrid myself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_90","text":"Sorry?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_91","text":"I'll go and tell Ingrid.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_92","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_92","text":"If you're aware things are going awry but can't muster the gumption to make a change,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_93","text":"just let those around you lend a hand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_94","text":"Absolutely not!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_95","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_95","text":"...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_96","text":"Sixo will notice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_97","text":"You must never get involved. I'm begging you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_98","text":"They are just some lowlifes resorting to threats to get what they want.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_99","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_99","text":"What's there to fear? Those types are powerless against anyone with the guts to stand up to them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_100","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_100","text":"You must not underestimate Sixo,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_101","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_101","text":"as they are the Master behind the Dark Net.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_102","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_102","text":"The Dark Net is a foul creation, a cancerous tumor that has no right existing in the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_103","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_103","text":"All manner of illicit goods are bought and sold through the Dark Net. Weapons, drugs, anything you can think of.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_104","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_104","text":"Even the bomb that Exotic used to blow a hole in the Ark was also obtained from the Dark Net.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_105","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_105","text":"I want to ask why do you think the Dark Net, a site where you can purchase all manner of dangerous items, has not been shut down.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_106","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_106","text":"Because it's connected to some high-ranking individuals?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_107","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_107","text":"That's possible, but there's an even simpler reason.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_108","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_108","text":"That's because the Central Government is unable to eradicate it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_109","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_109","text":"What?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_110","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_110","text":"No one knows Sixo's identity.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_111","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_111","text":"How old they are. Whether they're male or female, or if they're human or Nikke.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_112","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_112","text":"Nobody's ever seen them or heard their voice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_113","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_113","text":"They're like a ghost whose entire existence is relegated solely online.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_114","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_114","text":"Despite that, they're able to find out anything they want and exert some form of influence in every aspect of others' lives.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_115","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_115","text":"When you work as a transporter, you learn a lot about the underworld.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_116","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_116","text":"However, even as you're being inundated with other information, you never hear so much as a word about Sixo.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_117","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_117","text":"Not even rumors.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_118","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_118","text":"Whenever the Dark Net's servers get hacked, they're restored right away.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_119","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_119","text":"Physically destroying the server is impossible because no one knows where it is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_120","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_120","text":"Likewise, when it comes to apprehending the Master, no one knows so much as a single letter of their real name.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_121","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_121","text":"Because of that, the Dark Net is something the Ark is powerless to stop.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_122","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_122","text":"This Sixo is just a spineless scumbag.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_123","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_123","text":"Perhaps,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_124","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_124","text":"but their power is undeniable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_125","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_125","text":"Even if you can't see them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_126","type":"Speech","speaker":"drilley","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_126","text":"I'm not convinced.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_127","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_127","text":"Me neither. Just words won't do the trick for me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_128","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_128","text":"Regardless, I would ask you all to stay out of this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_129","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_129","text":"Don't get involved, for any reason.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_130","type":"Speech","speaker":"fragile","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_130","text":"What are you planning on doing?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_131","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_131","text":"If I give them a photo of a Pilgrim, maybe that could do something.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_132","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_132","text":"Delete the photo.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_133","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_133","text":"Excuse me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_134","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_134","text":"I promised the Unknown that we should delete any visual evidence of her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_135","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_135","text":"I-I don't understand what you're saying.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_136","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_136","text":"I briefly recounted our encounter with the Unknown to Liveryn.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_137","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_137","text":"So, let me get this straight.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_138","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_138","text":"In order to keep a promise you made to someone you barely know, whom we're not even sure is a friend or foe,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_139","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_139","text":"you're going to throw me to the wolves?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_140","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_140","text":"Liveryn.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_141","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_30_02_141","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_30_02_142","type":"Speech","speaker":"liveryn","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d